class TrialPatch(BaseModel):
    """
    The authored half of a Trial, and the WHOLE of what anyone may write.

    NO NOTES, unlike every other research entity, and that is a decision rather
    than an unfinished carrier -- 0135 shipped one and it was removed before
    anything used it (0 documents across 412 trials).

    A notes document earns its place where a description cannot hold what a later
    reader must distrust: a run lives for days and accumulates caveats, and
    destroying its description to record one is the trade notes exist to avoid. A
    rollout ran once and is immutable afterwards, so "the verifier timed out on
    this one" IS what this trial is -- the description is its home, and a second
    free-text field beside it is one place too many to look.

    Volume is the corroborating reason, not the main one: there is one Trial per
    rollout span, so this is the only entity whose notes tab would multiply with
    a training run's own scale.
    """

    description: Description | None = Field(None, title='Description')
    name: Name7 | None = Field(None, title='Name')


